      ],
      "source": "https://www.rockleighnj.org/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Rockleigh Road, the borough’s main thoroughfare, has historically linked the community to surrounding regions.",
